{"3163480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kosso Arena", "steam_appid": 3163480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a localized energy boundary in deep space, your combat unit is isolated against infinite waves of alien swarms. In <strong>Kosso Arena</strong>, there is nowhere to run—survival demands tight spatial maneuvering, precise positioning, and overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate hordes, collect energy cores, and customize your loadout on the fly. Build lethal projectile synergies, trigger cascading elemental reactions, and hold your ground in high-pressure 10-minute survival battles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Pressure Arena Survival:</strong> Confined within a compact energy perimeter, dodge dense swarms where every pixel of movement counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Modular Arsenal:</strong> Deploy a wide variety of weaponry—from ballistic auto-cannons and curved Bezier bows to cascading missiles, chain lightning, and orbital companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Perk Trees:</strong> Customize and mutate each weapon with deep upgrade forks, exclusive synergies, and lethal elemental debuffs (Burn, Freeze, Shock, Poison, and Execution).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Roguelite Loop:</strong> Quick, action-packed 10-minute runs designed for high replayability, featuring escalating difficulty waves and an optional overtime challenge.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a localized energy boundary in deep space, your combat unit is isolated against infinite waves of alien swarms. In <strong>Kosso Arena</strong>, there is nowhere to run—survival demands tight spatial maneuvering, precise positioning, and overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate hordes, collect energy cores, and customize your loadout on the fly. Build lethal projectile synergies, trigger cascading elemental reactions, and hold your ground in high-pressure 10-minute survival battles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Pressure Arena Survival:</strong> Confined within a compact energy perimeter, dodge dense swarms where every pixel of movement counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Modular Arsenal:</strong> Deploy a wide variety of weaponry—from ballistic auto-cannons and curved Bezier bows to cascading missiles, chain lightning, and orbital companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Perk Trees:</strong> Customize and mutate each weapon with deep upgrade forks, exclusive synergies, and lethal elemental debuffs (Burn, Freeze, Shock, Poison, and Execution).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Roguelite Loop:</strong> Quick, action-packed 10-minute runs designed for high replayability, featuring escalating difficulty waves and an optional overtime challenge.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Kosso Arena is an arena survivor-like set in the claustrophobic depths of space. Trapped in a tight energy perimeter, pilot an automated combat unit, dodge relentless alien swarms, and forge game-breaking weapon synergies to survive.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163480/31f85daf6181db043a0846e81ea23ca4e9325040/header.jpg?t=1787794539", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163480/fb78e64126e1e6a0df6b4887e155e9a2d3c82e2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787794539", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163480/fb78e64126e1e6a0df6b4887e155e9a2d3c82e2f/capsule_18